📅 Manufacturing Year Trend
Insight
Bike listings fluctuate across manufacturing years.
Sales decline slightly between 2016–2021.
Listings increase again in 2022–2024, indicating growing availability of newer bikes.
Business Insight

Customers are increasingly interested in newer models with improved technology and better fuel efficiency.

